\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {System Overview and Phase-Space Predictive Control.} (a) Physical experimental setup: Dual-camera neuromorphic vision setup ($C=4$: static eye-level observer + egocentric wrist sensor) monitoring a 6-DOF anthropomorphic manipulator executing variable-mass payload grasps ($1.20$--$4.50\,\text  {kg}$). Closed-loop Latent MPPI plans candidate action perturbations ($K=256$, horizon $H=20$) purely inside the latent phase space at $25\,\text  {Hz}$ ($38.9\,\text  {ms}$), displayed as a color-coded predictive rollout fan extending from the end-effector. (b) Latent phase-space trajectories ($t \in [0, 100]$) showing coordinate-momentum progression, contrasting the bounded phase-space dynamics of SPWM against continuous rate divergence.}}{2}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:teaser}{{1}{2}{}{figure.1}{}}
