\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {End-to-End SPWM Architecture.} The 4-stage dataflow: (1) \textit  {Perceptual Bottleneck}: Dual event-camera streams $\mathbf  {E}_t \in \{0, 1\}^{B \times 4 \times 32 \times 32}$ processed via parallel Conv2D stems, $1 \times 1$ cross-stream residual fusion, and SpatialSoftmax ($\tau = 1.0$) extracting topological keypoints $\mathbf  {k}_t \in [-1, 1]^{32}$ and continuous embedding $\mathbf  {x}_t \in \mathbb  {R}^{128}$; (2) \textit  {Recurrent Spiking Dynamics}: Predictive coding residual $\boldsymbol  {\epsilon }_t$ driving a two-tier ALIF core ($N=256$, fast pool $\tau \approx 0.47\,\text  {s}$ and slow pool $\tau \approx 3.28\,\text  {s}$), producing discrete spike pulses $\mathbf  {s}_t$ and continuous membrane states $\mathbf  {m}_t$; (3) \textit  {Phase-Space Partitioning}: Structural bifurcation into normalized momentum $\mathbf  {p}_{t+1} \in \mathbb  {R}^{96}$ and generalized coordinates $\mathbf  {q}_{t+1} \in \mathbb  {R}^{32}$ regulated by the Anti-Evanescence Stasis Gate $K_{\text  {gate}}$; (4) \textit  {Action-Conditioned Dissipative Predictor ($M_1$)}: Synthesizing state-dependent dissipation $\gamma _t \in (0, 1)^{96}$ and force heads $(\mathbf  {f}_p, \mathbf  {f}_q)$ under continuous soft-fade sensory handover ($w_t \in [0.0, 0.40]$), projected by the zero-lag Articulated PhysicalDecoder to joint kinematics $(\hat  {\mathbf  {q}}_t^*, \hat  {\mathbf  {p}}_t^*)$.}}{5}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{2}{5}{}{figure.2}{}}
